{"seq":2,"slug":"proxy-bid-anti-snipe","title":"代理出价与反狙击","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"proxy-bidding-agent","title":"代理出价（proxy bid）机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent","wordCount":1799,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-sniping-time-extend","title":"反狙击自动延时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"bid-withdraw-rule","title":"出价撤回与有效性规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule","wordCount":1979,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代理出价与反狙击\">代理出价与反狙击</h1><p>这一章的主题是<strong>时间与信息</strong>。拍卖规则本身不难，难的是在「用户不想盯着屏幕」和「用户想看到发生了什么」之间找平衡。三篇分别处理三个具体矛盾。</p>\n<p><a href=\"proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a> 是本 hub 技术上最核心的一篇。它把公开逐轮叫价折叠成「一次录入上限 + 服务端增量裁决」，当前价由次高上限推出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>current</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>highest</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> second</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>inc</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{current}=\\min(\\text{highest},\\ \\text{second}+\\text{inc})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">current</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">highest</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">second</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">inc</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。折叠带来两个新问题：上限必须绝对保密（它一旦泄露，对手的成交价就等于白送），以及增量裁决必须可重放（同一串出价事件在任何时刻重放都要得出同一个当前价）。文中给出的条件更新写法与并列打破规则（同价先到者优先）是后续章节的共同基础设施。</p>\n<p><a href=\"anti-sniping-time-extend\">反狙击自动延时</a> 处理的是另一个被实证研究确认过的规律：固定截止时间必然把出价挤到最后一刻。Roth 与 Ockenfels 用 eBay（固定截止）与 Amazon（自动延长）这对天然实验证明，结束规则本身就是末刻出价的重要策略决定因素。这一篇的重点不在「要不要延时」，而在延时把 <code>close_time</code> 从一个上架时写死的常量变成了会被事务修改的字段之后，哪些路径会因此出错——尤其是已经派发出去的结算任务必须能够被安全撤销。</p>\n<p><a href=\"bid-withdraw-rule\">出价撤回与有效规则</a> 处理「合法误操作的救济」。撤回在机制层面是不被鼓励的：如果撤回无成本，竞买人就能用出价试探对手上限再撤回，把代理出价的保密性彻底废掉。所以规则总是「有限允许」，而工程上的难点在于撤回一条<strong>最高出价</strong>时必须由剩余上限重新求解当前价，还要处理「撤回后没有任何有效出价」这个常被漏写的分支。这一篇引入的三层有效性划分（形式有效 / 机制有效 / 结算有效）会直接影响到第四章的风控判定。</p>\n<p>三篇合起来构成一条链：代理出价定义了「什么是当前价」，反狙击定义了「拍卖什么时候结束」，撤回定义了「一条出价什么时候算数」。这三件事都是同一把版本锁上的操作，必须线性化。</p>\n"}